Package: linux-headers-@REL@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: zhongfu <me@zhongfu.li>
Depends: linux-image-@REL@ (= @VERSION@)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: ZSpace T2 kernel headers for @REL@
 The prepared build tree for out-of-tree modules against the ZSpace T2 kernel
 @REL@, installed under /usr/src/linux-headers-@REL@/ with the usual
 /lib/modules/@REL@/build symlink pointing at it.
 .
 The tree is the kernel's own scripts/package/install-extmod-build output: the
 headers, Kbuild files and the host programs (modpost and friends) that
 `make -C /lib/modules/@REL@/build M=$PWD modules` needs, so no kernel source
 checkout is required to build or rebuild a module.
